OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed over grass cutting
OL,4,Adispute, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was run over and killed after
OL,7,Foffering to cut the grass of his
OL,8,Falleged killer's mother for #7.50, a
OL,9,Fcourt has heard.
OL,11,FMark Wigley, 60, his daughter Sarah
OL,12,FWigley, 39, and his brother-in-law Neil
OL,13,FShaw, 54, are accused of murdering Liam
OL,14,FGreen by hitting the 45-year-old with a
OL,15,FVW Touareg car on Rose Tree Avenue in
OL,16,FCudworth, near Barnsley, at about 17:00
OL,17,FBST on 3 April.
OL,19,FThe trio, of Royston Road, Barnsley,
OL,20,Fdeny murder and appeared at Sheffield
OL,21,FCrown Court on Tuesday for the start of
OL,22,Ftheir trial.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
